  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operational and Techincal Support to Taqaddum</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project aims to contribute to strengthening the operational capacity of Taqaddum. As a means to strengthen the participation of civilian and democratic forces of Sudan in the peace process, humanitarian response and transition to democratic rule. Special focus on inclusion and participation of women in the planning committee and founding convention.

Result 1: Taqaddum members across various convention planning committees have increased knowledge and understanding of logistics and facilitation requirements and apply them to convention planning.  

Result 2: 
Operations and logistics for the convention enhanced. 

Result 3: 
Post convention activities developed and implemented.</narrative>
  </description>
